    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "```\r\n  {\r\n    \"echasnovski/mini.surround\",\r\n    opts = {\r\n      search_method = \"cover_or_next\",\r\n    },\r\n  },\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I do `sd` on L2 (opts), it'd then delete quote from above and below L2 instead of jumping down and deleting those. Seems a bit weird. This doesn't happen on tpope's surround module.",
    "bodyHTML": "<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"  {\n    &quot;echasnovski/mini.surround&quot;,\n    opts = {\n      search_method = &quot;cover_or_next&quot;,\n    },\n  },\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">  {\n    \"echasnovski/mini.surround\",\n    opts = {\n      search_method = \"cover_or_next\",\n    },\n  },\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">If I do <code class=\"notranslate\">sd</code> on L2 (opts), it'd then delete quote from above and below L2 instead of jumping down and deleting those. Seems a bit weird. This doesn't happen on tpope's surround module.</p>",
    "bodyText": "{\n    \"echasnovski/mini.surround\",\n    opts = {\n      search_method = \"cover_or_next\",\n    },\n  },\n\nIf I do sd on L2 (opts), it'd then delete quote from above and below L2 instead of jumping down and deleting those. Seems a bit weird. This doesn't happen on tpope's surround module.",
